  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>95</x>
      <y>11696</y>
      <w>1050</w>
      <h>102</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>No save occurs for rejection, ambiguity, API errors, failed compatibility, fixed-constraint
violations or absent approval. Candidate in-memory changes must not replace the published session on
persistence failure.
fontsize=17
bg=#FFFBEF</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes />
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>95</x>
      <y>11898</y>
      <w>1050</w>
      <h>174</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Approval uses existing ShootPlan id/revision and the selected session. Initial proposals have a new
id and revision 1. Revision previews retain the saved base id and increment revision. approve()
reloads the session, rejects stale/foreign revisions, and revalidates current constraints before
append/save. No command is reapplied after the user approves the preview.
fontsize=17
bg=#FFFBEF</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes />
  </element>
